<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
<title>frontend-slides — Preset Gallery</title>
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Archivo+Black&family=Archivo:wght@400;600;800&family=Bodoni+Moda:opsz,wght@6..96,400;6..96,700&family=Cormorant+Garamond:wght@300;600&family=Cormorant:wght@300;600&family=DM+Sans:wght@400;700&family=Fraunces:opsz,wght@9..144,400;9..144,700&family=IBM+Plex+Sans:wght@300;500&family=JetBrains+Mono:wght@400;700&family=Manrope:wght@400;800&family=Nunito:wght@400;700&family=Outfit:wght@300;600;800&family=Plus+Jakarta+Sans:wght@400;800&family=Source+Serif+4:opsz,wght@8..60,400;8..60,600&family=Space+Grotesk:wght@400;700&family=Space+Mono:wght@400;700&family=Syne:wght@700;800&family=Work+Sans:wght@400;600&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
<style>
  /* ============================================================
     PRESET GALLERY — the rich reference for STYLE_PRESETS.md
     Each block below is a REAL rendering of one preset, not a
     description of one. To use a preset: copy its <section>,
     its :root block, and its .p-N rules into your deck.
     ============================================================ */

  * { box-sizing: border-box; }
  body {
    margin: 0;
    background: #101014;
    color: #e9e9ef;
    font-family: "Manrope", system-ui, sans-serif;
    padding: 40px 24px 80px;
  }
  .page { max-width: 1080px; margin: 0 auto; }
  h1.gal { font-family: "Archivo", sans-serif; font-weight: 800; font-size: 30px; margin: 0 0 6px; letter-spacing: -.02em; }
  p.gal { color: #9a9aa8; max-width: 68ch; margin: 0 0 40px; line-height: 1.6; font-size: 15px; }
  p.gal code { background: #22222c; padding: 2px 6px; border-radius: 3px; font-family: "JetBrains Mono", monospace; font-size: .85em; }

  .item { margin-bottom: 52px; }
  .bar {
    display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 4px 18px; align-items: baseline;
    border-bottom: 1px solid #2a2a34; padding-bottom: 8px; margin-bottom: 14px;
  }
  .bar .n { font-family: "JetBrains Mono", monospace; font-size: 12px; color: #6f6f80; }
  .bar .t { font-family: "Archivo", sans-serif; font-weight: 600; font-size: 17px; color: #fff; }
  .bar .m { font-size: 12.5px; color: #8a8a99; font-family: "JetBrains Mono", monospace; }

  /* every preset renders into this 16:9 stage */
  .slide {
    aspect-ratio: 16 / 9;
    width: 100%;
    overflow: hidden;
    position: relative;
    display: flex;
    border-radius: 4px;
  }
  .slide * { box-sizing: border-box; }

  /* ---------- 1. BOLD SIGNAL ---------- */
  .p1 { background:#1b1b1b; align-items:center; padding:0 5%; gap:4%; }
  .p1 .num { font-family:"Archivo Black",sans-serif; font-size:11vw; line-height:.8; color:#2c2c2c; }
  .p1 .card { background:#ff5a1f; padding:3.2% 3.6%; flex:1; }
  .p1 h2 { font-family:"Archivo Black",sans-serif; color:#fff; font-size:3.4vw; line-height:1.02; margin:0 0 1.4%; letter-spacing:-.02em; }
  .p1 p { font-family:"Space Grotesk",sans-serif; color:#1b1b1b; font-size:1.35vw; margin:0; line-height:1.45; font-weight:700; }

  /* ---------- 2. ELECTRIC STUDIO ---------- */
  .p2 { background:#000; font-family:"Manrope",sans-serif; }
  .p2 .l { flex:1.15; padding:5% 4%; display:flex; flex-direction:column; justify-content:center; }
  .p2 .r { flex:1; background:#1a4dff; display:flex; align-items:flex-end; padding:4%; }
  .p2 .kick { color:#1a4dff; font-weight:800; font-size:1.1vw; letter-spacing:.18em; text-transform:uppercase; margin-bottom:2.4%; }
  .p2 h2 { color:#fff; font-weight:800; font-size:3.6vw; line-height:1.03; margin:0; letter-spacing:-.03em; }
  .p2 .r span { color:#fff; font-weight:800; font-size:1.5vw; line-height:1.3; }

  /* ---------- 3. CREATIVE VOLTAGE ---------- */
  .p3 { background:#0b1a4d; flex-direction:column; justify-content:center; padding:0 5%; position:relative; }
  .p3::after { content:""; position:absolute; inset:0;
    background-image:radial-gradient(#1a4dff 1.1px, transparent 1.2px);
    background-size:11px 11px; opacity:.5; }
  .p3 > * { position:relative; }
  .p3 .badge { font-family:"Space Mono",monospace; background:#e8ff3a; color:#0b1a4d; font-weight:700;
    padding:.5% 1.4%; font-size:1.05vw; align-self:flex-start; margin-bottom:2.2%; }
  .p3 h2 { font-family:"Syne",sans-serif; font-weight:800; color:#fff; font-size:4.4vw; line-height:.98; margin:0 0 1.8%; letter-spacing:-.02em; }
  .p3 p { font-family:"Space Mono",monospace; color:#e8ff3a; font-size:1.25vw; margin:0; }

  /* ---------- 4. DARK BOTANICAL ---------- */
  .p4 { background:#0e0d0c; flex-direction:column; justify-content:center; padding:0 6%; position:relative; overflow:hidden; }
  .p4 .orb { position:absolute; border-radius:50%; filter:blur(46px); }
  .p4 .o1 { width:26%; aspect-ratio:1; background:#c96f4a; opacity:.5; right:6%; top:8%; }
  .p4 .o2 { width:18%; aspect-ratio:1; background:#e8b4a8; opacity:.35; right:22%; bottom:6%; }
  .p4 > *:not(.orb) { position:relative; }
  .p4 .rule { width:14%; height:1px; background:#c9a227; margin-bottom:2.6%; }
  .p4 h2 { font-family:"Cormorant",serif; font-weight:300; color:#f6efe6; font-size:4.6vw; line-height:1.04; margin:0 0 1.8%; }
  .p4 h2 em { font-style:italic; color:#c9a227; }
  .p4 p { font-family:"IBM Plex Sans",sans-serif; font-weight:300; color:#a89e93; font-size:1.2vw; margin:0; letter-spacing:.06em; }

  /* ---------- 5. NOTEBOOK TABS ---------- */
  .p5 { background:#26262b; align-items:center; justify-content:center; }
  .p5 .sheet { background:#f4efe3; width:82%; height:78%; position:relative; padding:4% 5%; display:flex; flex-direction:column; justify-content:center; }
  .p5 .tabs { position:absolute; right:-2.6%; top:12%; display:flex; flex-direction:column; gap:8px; }
  .p5 .tabs i { width:2.6vw; height:3.4vw; border-radius:0 3px 3px 0; display:block; }
  .p5 h2 { font-family:"Bodoni Moda",serif; font-weight:700; color:#26262b; font-size:3.6vw; line-height:1.05; margin:0 0 1.6%; }
  .p5 p { font-family:"DM Sans",sans-serif; color:#6b6659; font-size:1.2vw; margin:0; line-height:1.5; }
  .p5 .holes { position:absolute; left:2.4%; top:0; height:100%; display:flex; flex-direction:column; justify-content:center; gap:14%; }
  .p5 .holes i { width:.9vw; aspect-ratio:1; border-radius:50%; background:#26262b; opacity:.18; display:block; }

  /* ---------- 6. PASTEL GEOMETRY ---------- */
  .p6 { background:#dce8f5; font-family:"Plus Jakarta Sans",sans-serif; align-items:center; padding:0 5%; gap:3%; }
  .p6 .pills { display:flex; gap:10px; }
  .p6 .pills i { width:1.5vw; height:9vw; border-radius:99px; display:block; }
  .p6 .card { background:#fdf8ef; border-radius:20px; padding:3.4%; flex:1; box-shadow:0 14px 34px rgba(40,60,90,.13); }
  .p6 h2 { font-weight:800; color:#22364d; font-size:3.1vw; line-height:1.06; margin:0 0 1.6%; letter-spacing:-.02em; }
  .p6 p { color:#6d7f93; font-size:1.2vw; margin:0; line-height:1.5; }

  /* ---------- 7. SPLIT PASTEL ---------- */
  .p7 { font-family:"Outfit",sans-serif; background:linear-gradient(105deg,#ffd9c0 0 52%,#ddd2f7 52% 100%); align-items:center; padding:0 5%; }
  .p7 .box { flex:1; }
  .p7 .tag { display:inline-block; background:#a8e6cf; color:#1f3d33; border-radius:99px; padding:.5% 1.6%; font-weight:600; font-size:1.05vw; margin-bottom:2%; }
  .p7 h2 { font-weight:800; color:#2b2440; font-size:3.9vw; line-height:1.03; margin:0 0 1.6%; letter-spacing:-.025em; }
  .p7 p { font-weight:300; color:#54496f; font-size:1.25vw; margin:0; }
  .p7 .grid { flex:0 0 26%; height:60%; border:1px solid rgba(43,36,64,.22);
    background-image:linear-gradient(rgba(43,36,64,.13) 1px,transparent 1px),linear-gradient(90deg,rgba(43,36,64,.13) 1px,transparent 1px);
    background-size:22px 22px; border-radius:10px; }

  /* ---------- 8. VINTAGE EDITORIAL ---------- */
  .p8 { background:#f2ead9; flex-direction:column; justify-content:center; padding:0 6%; position:relative; }
  .p8 .dot { position:absolute; width:9%; aspect-ratio:1; border-radius:50%; background:#c4623f; right:8%; top:14%; opacity:.9; }
  .p8 .sq { position:absolute; width:5%; aspect-ratio:1; background:#2c2a26; right:20%; bottom:16%; }
  .p8 h2 { font-family:"Fraunces",serif; font-weight:700; color:#2c2a26; font-size:4.6vw; line-height:.99; margin:0 0 2.4%; letter-spacing:-.02em; position:relative; }
  .p8 .call { font-family:"Work Sans",sans-serif; border:2px solid #2c2a26; padding:1.4% 2%; align-self:flex-start; color:#2c2a26; font-size:1.2vw; font-weight:600; position:relative; }

  /* ---------- 9. NEON CYBER ---------- */
  .p9 { background:#070b1c; flex-direction:column; justify-content:center; padding:0 5.5%; position:relative; overflow:hidden; }
  .p9::before { content:""; position:absolute; inset:0;
    background-image:linear-gradient(rgba(0,229,255,.12) 1px,transparent 1px),linear-gradient(90deg,rgba(0,229,255,.12) 1px,transparent 1px);
    background-size:34px 34px; }
  .p9 .glow { position:absolute; width:34%; aspect-ratio:1; border-radius:50%; background:#ff2fd0; filter:blur(80px); opacity:.42; right:4%; top:16%; }
  .p9 > *:not(.glow) { position:relative; }
  .p9 .kick { font-family:"Space Grotesk",sans-serif; color:#00e5ff; font-size:1.05vw; letter-spacing:.3em; text-transform:uppercase; margin-bottom:2.2%; }
  .p9 h2 { font-family:"Space Grotesk",sans-serif; font-weight:700; color:#fff; font-size:4.2vw; line-height:1.0; margin:0 0 1.8%; letter-spacing:-.03em;
    text-shadow:0 0 22px rgba(0,229,255,.55); }
  .p9 p { font-family:"Manrope",sans-serif; color:#7f8db5; font-size:1.2vw; margin:0; }

  /* ---------- 10. TERMINAL GREEN ---------- */
  .p10 { background:#0d1117; font-family:"JetBrains Mono",monospace; flex-direction:column; justify-content:center; padding:0 5%; position:relative; }
  .p10::after { content:""; position:absolute; inset:0; pointer-events:none;
    background:repeating-linear-gradient(180deg,rgba(63,185,80,.05) 0 1px,transparent 1px 3px); }
  .p10 .chrome { position:absolute; top:5%; left:5%; display:flex; gap:7px; }
  .p10 .chrome i { width:.8vw; aspect-ratio:1; border-radius:50%; background:#30363d; display:block; }
  .p10 .cmd { color:#8b949e; font-size:1.15vw; margin-bottom:1.6%; }
  .p10 .cmd b { color:#3fb950; font-weight:400; }
  .p10 h2 { color:#3fb950; font-size:3.3vw; line-height:1.1; margin:0 0 1.6%; font-weight:700; }
  .p10 p { color:#8b949e; font-size:1.15vw; margin:0; }
  .p10 .cur { display:inline-block; width:.7em; height:1em; background:#3fb950; vertical-align:-.13em; }

  /* ---------- 11. SWISS MODERN ---------- */
  .p11 { background:#fff; font-family:"Archivo",sans-serif; position:relative; padding:6% 5%; flex-direction:column; justify-content:flex-end; }
  .p11 .lines { position:absolute; inset:0;
    background-image:linear-gradient(90deg,rgba(0,0,0,.09) 1px,transparent 1px); background-size:12.5% 100%; }
  .p11 .red { position:absolute; right:0; top:0; width:26%; height:34%; background:#e5231b; }
  .p11 > *:not(.lines):not(.red) { position:relative; }
  .p11 .idx { font-family:"Nunito",sans-serif; font-size:1.05vw; color:#e5231b; font-weight:700; letter-spacing:.16em; margin-bottom:1.6%; }
  .p11 h2 { font-weight:800; color:#000; font-size:4.6vw; line-height:.95; margin:0 0 1.6%; letter-spacing:-.04em; max-width:74%; }
  .p11 p { font-family:"Nunito",sans-serif; color:#555; font-size:1.2vw; margin:0; max-width:52%; line-height:1.45; }

  /* ---------- 12. PAPER & INK ---------- */
  .p12 { background:#faf5ea; flex-direction:column; justify-content:center; padding:0 8%; }
  .p12 .drop { float:left; font-family:"Cormorant Garamond",serif; font-weight:600; font-size:7.6vw; line-height:.78; color:#a3282a; margin:.1em .12em 0 0; }
  .p12 h2 { font-family:"Cormorant Garamond",serif; font-weight:300; color:#23211d; font-size:3.9vw; line-height:1.12; margin:0 0 2.2%; }
  .p12 .rule { width:100%; height:1px; background:#cfc4ae; margin-bottom:2.2%; }
  .p12 p { font-family:"Source Serif 4",serif; color:#5c554a; font-size:1.25vw; margin:0; line-height:1.55; max-width:74%; }

  @media (max-width: 640px) { body { padding: 24px 12px 60px; } }
</style>
</head>
<body>
<div class="page">

  <h1 class="gal">Preset Gallery</h1>
  <p class="gal">Twelve presets, rendered rather than described. Each stage below is a real 16:9 slide built from that preset's actual palette, type pairing, and signature device — so you pick by looking, not by imagining. To use one, copy its <code>&lt;section&gt;</code> markup and its <code>.pN</code> CSS block into your deck, then apply the Mandatory Base CSS from <code>STYLE_PRESETS.md</code>. Type sizes are in <code>vw</code> so every slide scales with the stage.</p>

  <div class="item">
    <div class="bar"><span class="n">01</span><span class="t">Bold Signal</span><span class="m">Archivo Black + Space Grotesk · pitch decks, launches</span></div>
    <section class="slide p1">
      <div class="num">03</div>
      <div class="card"><h2>Ship the thing that scares you.</h2><p>Momentum beats polish, every single quarter.</p></div>
    </section>
  </div>

  <div class="item">
    <div class="bar"><span class="n">02</span><span class="t">Electric Studio</span><span class="m">Manrope · client presentations, strategic reviews</span></div>
    <section class="slide p2">
      <div class="l"><div class="kick">Strategic Review</div><h2>Where the next dollar actually goes.</h2></div>
      <div class="r"><span>Q3 / 2026</span></div>
    </section>
  </div>

  <div class="item">
    <div class="bar"><span class="n">03</span><span class="t">Creative Voltage</span><span class="m">Syne + Space Mono · brand work, product storytelling</span></div>
    <section class="slide p3">
      <div class="badge">NEW WORK</div>
      <h2>Loud on purpose.</h2>
      <p>brand@voltage — case study 004</p>
    </section>
  </div>

  <div class="item">
    <div class="bar"><span class="n">04</span><span class="t">Dark Botanical</span><span class="m">Cormorant + IBM Plex Sans · luxury, premium product</span></div>
    <section class="slide p4">
      <div class="orb o1"></div><div class="orb o2"></div>
      <div class="rule"></div>
      <h2>Quiet things, made <em>beautifully</em>.</h2>
      <p>THE ATELIER COLLECTION</p>
    </section>
  </div>

  <div class="item">
    <div class="bar"><span class="n">05</span><span class="t">Notebook Tabs</span><span class="m">Bodoni Moda + DM Sans · reports, structured storytelling</span></div>
    <section class="slide p5">
      <div class="sheet">
        <div class="holes"><i></i><i></i><i></i></div>
        <div class="tabs"><i style="background:#e8b4c8"></i><i style="background:#b4d8e8"></i><i style="background:#cfe8b4"></i></div>
        <h2>Section Two: What the data withheld.</h2>
        <p>Findings, caveats, and the three numbers that changed our minds.</p>
      </div>
    </section>
  </div>

  <div class="item">
    <div class="bar"><span class="n">06</span><span class="t">Pastel Geometry</span><span class="m">Plus Jakarta Sans · product overviews, onboarding</span></div>
    <section class="slide p6">
      <div class="pills"><i style="background:#f5c2d5"></i><i style="background:#a8e6cf"></i><i style="background:#c9bef0"></i></div>
      <div class="card"><h2>Everything in one calm place.</h2><p>Set it up once. It keeps itself tidy after that.</p></div>
    </section>
  </div>

  <div class="item">
    <div class="bar"><span class="n">07</span><span class="t">Split Pastel</span><span class="m">Outfit · agency intros, workshops, portfolios</span></div>
    <section class="slide p7">
      <div class="box"><span class="tag">Workshop 02</span><h2>Make it, then make it obvious.</h2><p>A two-hour session on cutting the second draft.</p></div>
      <div class="grid"></div>
    </section>
  </div>

  <div class="item">
    <div class="bar"><span class="n">08</span><span class="t">Vintage Editorial</span><span class="m">Fraunces + Work Sans · personal brands, opinionated talks</span></div>
    <section class="slide p8">
      <div class="dot"></div><div class="sq"></div>
      <h2>Nobody asked<br>for another<br>framework.</h2>
      <div class="call">And yet. Here we are.</div>
    </section>
  </div>

  <div class="item">
    <div class="bar"><span class="n">09</span><span class="t">Neon Cyber</span><span class="m">Clash Display + Satoshi (Space Grotesk fallback) · AI, infra, dev tools</span></div>
    <section class="slide p9">
      <div class="glow"></div>
      <div class="kick">Inference / Runtime</div>
      <h2>Latency is the whole product.</h2>
      <p>p99 under 40ms, or it does not ship.</p>
    </section>
  </div>

  <div class="item">
    <div class="bar"><span class="n">10</span><span class="t">Terminal Green</span><span class="m">JetBrains Mono · APIs, CLI tools, engineering demos</span></div>
    <section class="slide p10">
      <div class="chrome"><i></i><i></i><i></i></div>
      <div class="cmd">$ <b>deploy</b> --env prod --verify</div>
      <h2>Zero downtime, by default.</h2>
      <p>Health checks gate every rollout.<span class="cur"></span></p>
    </section>
  </div>

  <div class="item">
    <div class="bar"><span class="n">11</span><span class="t">Swiss Modern</span><span class="m">Archivo + Nunito · corporate, product strategy, analytics</span></div>
    <section class="slide p11">
      <div class="lines"></div><div class="red"></div>
      <div class="idx">SECTION 04</div>
      <h2>Fewer metrics, held honestly.</h2>
      <p>Four numbers the whole org can recite. Everything else is diagnostic.</p>
    </section>
  </div>

  <div class="item">
    <div class="bar"><span class="n">12</span><span class="t">Paper &amp; Ink</span><span class="m">Cormorant Garamond + Source Serif 4 · essays, manifesto decks</span></div>
    <section class="slide p12">
      <h2><span class="drop">W</span>e kept optimising the thing that was never the bottleneck.</h2>
      <div class="rule"></div>
      <p>On attention, and the quiet cost of measuring what is easy to measure.</p>
    </section>
  </div>

</div>
</body>
</html>
